== Immersion Blender Method ==

Whisk @water{2%tsp} and @cornstarch{2%tsp} together to form a slurry.

Melt the @Vegan Butter{1/2%cup}(1 stick) (I do mine in the microwave until melted), then add @Frank's Red Hot Sauce{1%cup}, @garlic powder{1%tsp}, @Vegan Worcestershire{1%tbsp}, @cayenne pepper{1/2%tsp}, and @salt{to taste} and @ground black pepper{to taste} including the cornstarch slurry into a jar / immersion cup. Blend with an immersion blender, slowly moving up to incorporate all the ingredients. After ~{30%seconds}, you'll have a smooth sauce!

Add the sauce to a #saucepan{} over medium low heat, and heat to activate the cornstarch slurry. Once it thickens you're done! If the emulsion ever breaks, you can simply blend it again and it'll be smooth again!